# Keep test parsing deterministic across platforms: these files are split on
# newline-anchored regexes, and a CRLF checkout silently made them match nothing.
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# The boss models. Marked binary explicitly rather than left to git's
# content sniffing, for the same reason the rules above exist: this repository
# has already been bitten once by an eol conversion silently rewriting a file it
# should not have touched. A single CRLF inserted into an .m2 shifts every
# offset in its header and the model simply fails to parse, with no error that
# points anywhere near the cause.
*.m2 binary
*.skin binary
*.blp binary
